        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Another Game About Clicking</strong>, where every click brings you closer to a colorful collection of adorable… and sometimes fearsome, companions! Dive into a minimalist universe filled with creatures ranging from the adorable squirrel to the formidable bear, all ready to join you on your clicker and idle adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Addictive click mechanics:</strong> every click counts, every upgrade matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle mode:</strong> your production continues even when you’re not playing; come back later to collect your rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet collection:</strong> gather companions from the explorer squirrel to the giant bear; the first clicker game that’s also undeniably cute.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade system:</strong> spend your coins to boost your production and cut down wait times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prestige with Golden Eggs:</strong> reset your progress to earn Golden Eggs and gain permanent multipliers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing minigame:</strong> yes, you read that right; the first clicker with a fishing minigame.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements:</strong> will you reach your first quintillion? Unlock them all.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Another Game About Clicking</strong>, where every click brings you closer to a colorful collection of adorable… and sometimes fearsome, companions! Dive into a minimalist universe filled with creatures ranging from the adorable squirrel to the formidable bear, all ready to join you on your clicker and idle adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Addictive click mechanics:</strong> every click counts, every upgrade matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle mode:</strong> your production continues even when you’re not playing; come back later to collect your rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet collection:</strong> gather companions from the explorer squirrel to the giant bear; the first clicker game that’s also undeniably cute.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade system:</strong> spend your coins to boost your production and cut down wait times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prestige with Golden Eggs:</strong> reset your progress to earn Golden Eggs and gain permanent multipliers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing minigame:</strong> yes, you read that right; the first clicker with a fishing minigame.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements:</strong> will you reach your first quintillion? Unlock them all.</p></li></ul>",
